# Deno lockfile for supabase/functions.
#
# Deliberately not committed. The local toolchain (denoland/deno:latest, via
# the container in AGENTS.md) writes lockfile version 5, while the deployed
# edge runtime is pinned to Deno 2.1.4, which only reads version 4 -- a
# committed lock would be a deploy failure that cannot be reproduced locally.
#
# Reproducibility does not depend on it: every import in supabase/functions
# names an exact version (npm:stripe@23.2.0, npm:@supabase/supabase-js@2.119.2),
# not a range.
functions/deno.lock
